{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Thus.</b> Nevertheless it shall come to pass in those days, that when the new wine is found in a cluster, a man will say to his fellow: Do not destroy it; and he will say: For blessing is in it. So will I do for the sake of My servants — they are the righteous of Israel in exile — so as not to destroy everything."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 65, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:00.707996638Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}